:** `payments-worker` is now healthy on v3.3.0 in all regions, with the error rate down to 0.2%.\n\nNote: `payments-api` is currently on v5.1.0 and shows as degraded/unhealthy \u2014 it may share the same incident, but since the approver identified payments-worker as the culprit and it's now healthy, I did not roll it back. Worth investigating `payments-api` separately if errors persist.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "I'll start by checking the deployment history to identify the most recent healthy release, and the current service status.", "reasoning_content": "Check deployments for payments service.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a141351e4f71149cb8afcc", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payments\"}", "name": "list_deployments"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a141351e4f71149cb8afcd", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payments\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "The service name \"payments\" isn't recognized \u2014 let me try likely variants.", "reasoning_content": "The service \"payments\" is unknown. Maybe it has a different name. Let me try \"payment\" or \"payment-service\".", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a141353f53769385cc03f9", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payment\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a141353f53769385cc03fa", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payment-service\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a14135453f7268a72bc88c", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payments-service\"}", "name": "get_service_status"